      "apiDescription": "## Models\n\nTwo-way bindings. Bind each one with the `v-model` syntax shown next to it — do not pass the prop and listen to its `update:` event separately.\n\n```\nexport type GCollapseModels = {\n  /**\n   * @description currently active panel, the type is `string` in accordion mode, otherwise it is `array`\n   * @default mutable([] as const)\n   */\n  modelValue?: CollapseModelValue; // v-model=\"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\n```\nexport type GCollapseProps = {\n  /**\n   * @description set expand icon position\n   * @default 'right'\n   */\n  expandIconPosition?: CollapseIconPositionType;\n  /**\n   * @description items of the collapse component\n   * @default mutable([] as const)\n   */\n  items?: CollapseItemType[];\n  /** @description whether to activate accordion mode */\n  accordion?: boolean;\n  /** @description before-collapse hook before the collapse state changes. If `false` is returned or a `Promise` is returned and then is rejected, will stop collapsing */\n  beforeCollapse?: ((name: CollapseActiveName) => Awaitable<boolean>);\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type GCollapseEvents = {\n  \"update:modelValue\": [value: CollapseModelValue];\n  change: [value: CollapseModelValue];\n  \"header-click\": [name: CollapseActiveName];\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type GCollapseSlots = {\n  default: { item: CollapseItemType; isActive: boolean | undefined; name: CollapseActiveName; title: string; description: string; disabled: boolean; headerOnly: boolean; expandIconPosition: \"left\" | \"right\"; hideIcon: boolean; iconsLeft: (IconsType | { icon: string; onClick: () => void; })[]; iconsRight: (IconsType | { icon: string; onClick: () => void; })[]; focusing: boolean; };\n  header: { item: CollapseItemType; isActive: boolean | undefined; name: CollapseActiveName; title: string; description: string; disabled: boolean; headerOnly: boolean; expandIconPosition: \"left\" | \"right\"; hideIcon: boolean; iconsLeft: (IconsType | { icon: string; onClick: () => void; })[]; iconsRight: (IconsType | { icon: string; onClick: () => void; })[]; focusing: boolean; };\n  dynamic: {};\n}\n```\n\n## Exposed\n\nAvailable on the component instance through a template ref.\n\n```\nexport type GCollapseExposed = {\n  /** @description active names */\n  activeNames: (string | number)[];\n  /** @description set active names */\n  setActiveNames: (_activeNames: CollapseActiveName[]) => void;\n}\n```",
      "renderer": "vue3"
    }
  }
